					<string name="Name">Weld</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">--thank you for useing togaboy531&apos;s weld script. its my very first but it works!
--all YOU need to do is create a model with all the bricks that you want togeth touching.
--then make sure all the sides touching have the surface of glue or weld.
--then simpilly insert this script into the model you made!


c = script.Parent.GetChildren()
e = true

if e = true then
	c:MakeJoints()
end
